Don't stop, don't stop! Just go your own way!

204
01:09:06,717 --> 01:09:12,717
Kikkeriki!

205
01:09:16,217 --> 01:09:25,217
Hello! Welcome everybody to Takanashi Kiara and hololive English's 1st ever concert, Connect the World!

206
01:09:28,217 --> 01:09:32,717
I can hear you guys so clearly, and I can see you guys so clearly!

207
01:09:32,717 --> 01:09:35,017
Hi everybody! Hi, hi!

208
01:09:35,717 --> 01:09:39,717
Oh my god, we're in Los Angeles!

209
01:09:43,717 --> 01:09:49,717
So we started off with the iconic and classic songs of mine, Hinotori and SParks!

210
01:09:49,717 --> 01:09:52,717
Don't we love those songs? Was that hype?

211
01:09:54,717 --> 01:10:02,217
Yeah! You guys know, like Hinotori was my first ever original song to put out, and...

212
01:10:02,217 --> 01:10:03,717
...yeah, it was like the beginning of my music...

213
01:10:04,041 --> 01:10:05,141
...musical history,

214
01:10:05,141 --> 01:10:07,041
my musical journey,

215
01:10:07,041 --> 01:10:09,141
and it's a song that means a lot to me.

216
01:10:09,141 --> 01:10:11,441
And it's just so hype. It was also the first ever...

217
01:10:11,441 --> 01:10:14,541
...time that I appeared in 3D, I think, long time ago

218
01:10:14,541 --> 01:10:17,241
at Fes in Japan, right? Remember?

219
01:10:17,241 --> 01:10:19,541
Good times! Yeah!

220
01:10:21,341 --> 01:10:24,141
Thank you so much for cheering so loudly! You did so well!

221
01:10:24,141 --> 01:10:27,041
Yeah!

222
01:10:27,041 --> 01:10:31,541
I have been training so hard the past months in the gym,

223
01:10:31,541 --> 01:10:34,541
trying to get stamina for this day,

224
01:10:34,541 --> 01:10:38,541
because I think I learned about...

225
01:10:38,541 --> 01:10:43,841
...learned and relearned about 20 choreographies!

226
01:10:43,841 --> 01:10:48,241
Crazy, right?

227
01:10:48,241 --> 01:10:50,541
Damn, that was a lot of work.

228
01:10:50,541 --> 01:10:54,041
But finally the day has come to show it off to all of you!

229
01:10:54,041 --> 01:10:56,941
I want to say hi, by the way,

230
01:10:56,941 --> 01:11:00,841
to all the live viewers worldwide!

231
01:11:00,841 --> 01:11:04,841
There's so many cinemas showing this concert right now.

232
01:11:04,841 --> 01:11:08,241
Hello, world!

