01:11:08,241 --> 01:11:10,841
Can you hear me? I wonder if I can hear them.

234
01:11:10,841 --> 01:11:13,541
Can I hear them over the continents?

235
01:11:13,541 --> 01:11:16,841
Well, that's you guys!

236
01:11:16,841 --> 01:11:19,541
But I think I can hear them, yeah!

237
01:11:19,541 --> 01:11:26,541
Also, there's stream girls watching on YouTube right now, like Ollie and all the EN members!

238
01:11:26,541 --> 01:11:31,041
Hi! Thank you!

239
01:11:31,041 --> 01:11:33,241
So excited!

240
01:11:33,241 --> 01:11:40,241
I have to give a little bit of an announcement from my side, actually.

241
01:11:40,241 --> 01:11:46,241
Because it's very important, it has to be in the free part, because everybody needs to hear this.

242
01:11:46,241 --> 01:11:52,041
My new album, Vogelfrei, you got it, right?

243
01:11:52,041 --> 01:11:54,041
Thank you!

244
01:11:54,041 --> 01:12:00,041
But in case you didn't, a second round of album sales has begun!

245
01:12:03,841 --> 01:12:12,841
Yeah! So if you missed it previously or you want a new copy, starting from Saturday, March 28th, at 11 PM...

246
01:12:12,841 --> 01:12:14,841
