247
01:12:14,841 --> 01:12:18,241
Who knows, we'll find out, probably JST.

248
01:12:18,241 --> 01:12:23,041
You will be able to order Vogelfrei again! So please, everybody, order Vogelfrei!

249
01:12:23,041 --> 01:12:32,041
So far, the songs that I performed up until now were not even from Vogelfrei, but don't worry, I'm squeezing everything in that I can.

250
01:12:32,041 --> 01:12:33,541
Yeah!

